From 9c80eae242a669a104284fc7c75b7eeb8634708f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spike <spike@localhost>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 14:13:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] prototype: library modules warn about app build types
 that fall back to them (X1)

A library has variants only for the build types it declares; an app build type
it lacks gets its matchingFallbacks variant and that variant's environment. The
library now reads the depending app modules' build types after configuration,
warns when the fallback's environment differs from what the app build type would
select, and marks the fallback's generation line (survives CC reuse).
palbase.env.<appBuildType>=<fallback env> acknowledges it. Skipped under
Isolated Projects.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
